Pembagian Tanggung Jawab File
File	Tanggung Jawab	Isi Tipikal
app.js	Namespace root + init + error boundary	App.init(), orchestrator, fallback handler
store.js	State management	Data, state object, getter/setter, constants
[domain].js	Business logic + rendering domain	Kalkulasi, algoritma, Canvas/SVG drawing
ui.js	DOM interaction	Event binding, DOM updates, form handling
[component].js	Komponen UI mandiri	Render + behavior satu komponen (Modal, Chart, Map)
Aturan Penempatan Fungsi Campuran
Jika fungsi melakukan logic + render + DOM update, prioritaskan:
Pisah jika memungkinkan (logic murni → domain.js, DOM → ui.js)
Gabung di domain.js jika pemisahan merusak kohesi (contoh: game loop, real-time chart)
Jangan duplikasi logic di ui.js. ui.js hanya memanggil fungsi dari domain
🔄 PROSES KONVERSI (8 LANGKAH)
1. ANALISIS SUMBER
Scan semua file (HTML, JS, CSS, components, assets)
Mapping fitur: apa yang dilakukan sistem?
Catat: routing, state global, API calls, komponen, animasi
Identifikasi library eksternal yang dipakai
2. EKSTRAKSI ASET
Gambar: Pindahkan ke assets/images/, update path relatif
Font: Download dan simpan di assets/fonts/, update @font-face
Library: Download production version ke lib/ (Chart.js, Leaflet, D3, dll)
Data: Ubah API calls menjadi JSON statis di assets/data/
3. DEKOMPOSISI STATE & LOGIC
Identifikasi semua state global → kandidat store.js
Identifikasi fungsi murni (input → output) → kandidat [domain].js
Identifikasi side effects (DOM, event) → kandidat ui.js
Buat dependency graph: siapa butuh siapa?
4. KONVERSI FRAMEWORK → VANILLA
Framework Pattern	Konversi Vanilla
useState(init)	App.store.state = init + manual re-render
useEffect(fn, [])	Panggil fn() di App.init()
ref(null)	document.querySelector() / App.store.refs.el
JSX <div>{val}</div>	element.textContent = val
v-for/v-if	Loop for + if + innerHTML atau createElement
@click/onClick	element.addEventListener('click', fn)
Component .vue/.jsx	Fungsi factory createComponent() di file terpisah
react-router	Hash-based routing sederhana di app.js
5. BANGUN STRUKTUR FILE
Urutan pembangunan:
store.js → namespace + state + getter/setter
[domain].js → fungsi logic murni
Komponen tambahan (jika ada)
ui.js → DOM binding + event handlers
app.js → namespace root, init(), error boundary
index.html → struktur minimal, load script berurutan
style.css → gabung semua style, hapus CSS-in-JS
6. HANDLE EDGE CASES
Routing SPA: Implementasikan hash router sederhana
Lazy Loading: Ganti dengan conditional script loading atau inline
Environment Variables: Hardcode di store.js dengan komentar jelas
SSR/Static Generation: Abaikan, fokus pada client-side rendering
CSS Modules: Flatten ke class selector unik manual
TypeScript: Strip types, tambahkan JSDoc comments
7. ERROR HANDLING & FALLBACK
Tambahkan di app.js:
code
JavaScript
ns.init = function() {
    try {
        ns.store.initialize();
        ns.domain.init();
        ns.ui.bindEvents();
        console.log('✅ App initialized successfully');
    } catch (error) {
        console.error('❌ App initialization failed:', error);
        ns.showFallbackError(error);
    }
};

ns.showFallbackError = function(error) {
    document.body.innerHTML = `
        <div style="padding:2rem;text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;">
            <h2>⚠️ Application Error</h2>
            <p>${error.message}</p>
            <small>Check browser console (F12) for details</small>
        </div>`;
};
